Pehli Dafa guitar chords with strumming pattern, A beautiful love song sung by Atif Aslam feat. Ileana D'Cruz. Produced by Shiraz Uppal under T-Series music label while lyrics by Shakeel Sohail.

Strumming Pattern: DDU UDUD DU UDUD OR DDU UDUD

